{
  "set": "kanon-x402",
  "retrieved": "2026-11-02",
  "note": "Kanon x402 v2 exact/EVM/EIP-3009 exact-syntax conformance corpus (10 single-fault vectors), vendored as third-party test DATA only. The harness extracts each vector's verbatim decoded x402 v2 input, runs it through the art-590 -> art-591 -> art-592 chain plus an amount compare, and compares the resulting (valid, reason_code) verdict to the vector's expected verdict in Kanon's normative check order. Nothing here is imported as a code path; the reason-code registry (schema/reason-codes.md) is vendored so the normative order the harness implements is citable in-repo.",
